CHAPTER.VERS:
Therefore [you

          {+}
        ] must surely be in subjection, not only because of wrath, but also because of conscience.

For this cause you

          {+}
         pay taxes also; for they are ministers of God's service, attending continually on this very thing.

And this, knowing the season, that already it is time for you

          {+}
         to awake out of sleep: for now is salvation nearer to us than when we believed.

But put

          {+}
         on the Lord Jesus Christ, and don't make provision for the flesh, to [fulfill] the desires [of it].
